% how to make a conical helix

% Rob Scharein, 15 May 2001


reset all 
cyl=.3
draw spec

line dir 0 .1   % about make a line in the y-direction
line num 160    % with 160 beads

line            % make the line
centre          % and centre it.

trans 3         % translate it off to one side
swirl end 1800  % and give it a swirl.
                % swirl amount is x full rotations.

about x 90
skew 3
about x -90







